  render_theorem(sec, "Cube Hamming Weight Theorem", "Weight = number of 1-bits in cube address. D=0, E=1, L=1, b=2, GATE=2, K=3. Sum = K^2 = 9. All antipodal sums = K: D+K = E+GATE = b+L = 3. Full cube weight = heartbeat (12). Forbidden pair removes K. heartbeat - K = K^2 = web. Closure removes itself to create the spider.");
